# The bundled contract and the generated client types ARE committed, so a
# developer on Expo Go never needs the Redocly toolchain to build. They are
# marked merge=binary in .gitattributes: never hand-merge them, run
# `pnpm gen && git add`. CI enforces they are in sync via `pnpm gen:check`.
